WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.141 --> 00:00:09.209
- YOU GUYS SEE ANYTHING?

00:00:09.309 --> 00:00:10.511
- NOTHING YET.

00:00:10.611 --> 00:00:14.381
- OKAY.

00:00:14.481 --> 00:00:18.218
WE'LL WAIT UNTIL DARK, AND THEN
SNEAK BACK ACROSS THE LINE,

00:00:18.318 --> 00:00:20.354
AND REJOIN OUR UNIT.

00:00:20.454 --> 00:00:21.989
[distant gunfire]

00:00:22.089 --> 00:00:23.957
DID YOU GUYS HEAR SOMETHING?

00:00:24.057 --> 00:00:27.528
[machine gun fire]

00:00:32.466 --> 00:00:33.400
OH, HELL.

00:00:42.709 --> 00:00:46.079
- THESE AMERICANS
PROVE TO BE NO OBSTACLE AT ALL.

00:00:46.180 --> 00:00:49.950
SEARCH THE HOTEL.
- YEAH.

00:00:50.050 --> 00:00:53.020
- YOU'VE DONE WELL
TO SECURE THIS POSITION.

00:00:53.120 --> 00:00:56.256
THAT COULD BODE WELL
FOR PROMOTION.

00:00:56.356 --> 00:01:00.594
SPEAKING OF WHICH, GUESS WHO I
SAW AT THE MARKET THE OTHER DAY.

00:01:00.694 --> 00:01:01.695
- WHO?

00:01:01.795 --> 00:01:03.964
- OH, I DON'T KNOW,
ADOLF HITLER.

00:01:04.064 --> 00:01:05.399
- I LOVE HITLER.

00:01:05.499 --> 00:01:07.868
- WHO DOESN'T?
BUT YOU EVER SEE HIM IN PERSON?

00:01:07.968 --> 00:01:09.770
- OH, YEAH.
AT THE NUREMBERG RALLY.

00:01:09.870 --> 00:01:11.705
IT WAS VERY INSPIRATIONAL.

00:01:11.805 --> 00:01:12.739
- I KNOW IT WAS.
I WAS THERE.

00:01:12.840 --> 00:01:14.007
EVERYONE WAS THERE.

00:01:14.107 --> 00:01:17.744
BUT UP CLOSE,
IT'S A WHOLE DIFFERENT THING.

00:01:17.845 --> 00:01:19.746
FOR INSTANCE,
IT WAS THE WEEKEND,

00:01:19.847 --> 00:01:22.616
AND THE LITTLE HAIRS HAD JUST
STARTED TO GROW ON THE SIDES

00:01:22.716 --> 00:01:24.351
OF THE MUSTACHE, LIKE THIS.

00:01:24.451 --> 00:01:27.354
SO I WALK UP TO HITLER,
CASUALLY...

00:01:27.454 --> 00:01:29.523
- HERR COMMANDANT.
- THAT'S RUDE.

00:01:29.623 --> 00:01:31.091
I'M IN THE MIDDLE OF A STORY.

00:01:31.191 --> 00:01:33.026
YOU'RE NOT INTERESTED
IN A STORY ABOUT OUR FUHRER?

00:01:33.126 --> 00:01:34.228
- YEAH, BUT--
- OKAY, GOOD.

00:01:34.328 --> 00:01:35.762
EVA WAS THERE AS WELL,

00:01:35.863 --> 00:01:38.098
TALLER THAN YOU THINK
OR HITLER'S SHORTER,

00:01:38.198 --> 00:01:39.233
HARD TO SAY.

00:01:39.333 --> 00:01:42.669
BUT ANYHOO,
I'M BUYING SOME BREAD.

00:01:42.769 --> 00:01:44.938
HITLER'S BUYING SOME BREAD.
- UM, I MUST--

00:01:45.038 --> 00:01:47.708
- SO, I'M ASSUMING YOU'VE GOT
A BETTER HITLER STORY?

00:01:47.808 --> 00:01:51.845
- BUT NO, BUT--
- THEN MAYBE DON'T INTERRUPT.

00:01:51.945 --> 00:01:54.815
- YES, SIR.
- SO I GIVE HIM A SALUTE,

00:01:54.915 --> 00:01:57.251
AND HE GIVES ME ONE OF THOSE
HALF HITLER SALUTES, YOU KNOW,

00:01:57.351 --> 00:01:58.986
DOWN, LOW, VERY COOL.
- RIGHT.

00:01:59.086 --> 00:02:00.053
- YOU KNOW?
- RIGHT.

00:02:00.153 --> 00:02:02.022
- HERE'S WHAT YOU FORGET.
- YEAH.

00:02:02.122 --> 00:02:04.191
- HE DOESN'T SAY "HEIL HITLER."
- UH-HUH.

00:02:04.291 --> 00:02:05.192
[fly buzzing]
- ISN'T THAT FUNNY?

00:02:05.292 --> 00:02:06.793
[slap]

00:02:06.894 --> 00:02:07.828
- AH! HERR COMMANDANT--

00:02:07.928 --> 00:02:08.829
- OH, WAIT.

00:02:08.929 --> 00:02:10.197
I THINK MAYBE NEXT TIME,

00:02:10.297 --> 00:02:12.799
I'LL TELL HIM HOW UNINTERESTED
YOU ARE IN MY STORY.

00:02:12.900 --> 00:02:14.268
- OH, NO, NO, NO, NO.
- IS IT A JEALOUSY THING?

00:02:14.368 --> 00:02:15.903
- NO, NO, NO.
- YOU KNOW, I DIDN'T MEET HITLER

00:02:16.003 --> 00:02:17.037
TO HURT YOUR FEELINGS.

00:02:17.137 --> 00:02:22.009
- [stammers]
PROCEED, OF COURSE.

00:02:22.109 --> 00:02:23.410
- SO I SAY TO HITLER,

00:02:23.510 --> 00:02:25.412
"I'VE ACTUALLY BEEN QUITE BUSY."
[wrapper crinkles]

00:02:25.512 --> 00:02:28.815
HITLER LAUGHS, AND THEN SAYS,

00:02:28.916 --> 00:02:30.651
"YOU AND ME BOTH."

00:02:30.751 --> 00:02:32.319
I MEAN, HE'S THE FUHRER.

00:02:32.419 --> 00:02:34.888
IT'S SO FUNNY
BECAUSE IT'S AN UNDERSTATEMENT.

00:02:34.988 --> 00:02:37.324
I MEAN, HE'S SUPER BUSY.

00:02:37.424 --> 00:02:38.659
AS HITLER WAS TAKING HIS LEAVE
OF ME--

00:02:38.759 --> 00:02:39.960
- OKAY, I HAVE TO INTERRUPT
YOU RIGHT NOW.

00:02:40.060 --> 00:02:42.129
- EXCUSE ME?
DURING THE CINEMA?

00:02:42.229 --> 00:02:44.164
THE STORY HAS A BUILD.

00:02:44.264 --> 00:02:47.167
BUT IF YOU KEEP INTERRUPTING,
YOU KILL THE MOMENTUM.

00:02:47.267 --> 00:02:51.905
- I'M TRYING TO TELL YOU
THAT BODY IS MOVING.

00:02:52.005 --> 00:02:52.906
- THAT'S RIDICULOUS.

00:02:53.006 --> 00:02:54.541
THE AMERICAN'S ARE ALL DEAD.

00:02:54.641 --> 00:02:56.310
BUT IF IT KEEPS YOU
FROM INTERRUPTING

00:02:56.410 --> 00:02:59.546
MY AWESOME HITLER STORY,
I'LL PROVE IT TO YOU.

00:02:59.646 --> 00:03:02.149
- YES.
VERY GOOD, SIR.

00:03:20.033 --> 00:03:20.968
[grunts]

00:03:25.939 --> 00:03:26.874
[grunts]

00:03:32.713 --> 00:03:33.647
[grunts]

00:03:34.748 --> 00:03:35.716
[grunts]

00:03:36.783 --> 00:03:38.552
[grunts]

00:03:38.652 --> 00:03:42.823
WOW. I'LL NEVER GET USED
TO THOSE FINAL DEATH THROES.

00:03:42.923 --> 00:03:44.591
- DEATH THROES?

00:03:44.691 --> 00:03:48.028
HERR MULLER,
WHAT IS WRONG WITH YOU?

00:03:48.128 --> 00:03:50.197
THOSE ARE NOT DEATH THROES!

00:03:50.297 --> 00:03:52.165
YOU ARE BEING AN IDIOT!

00:03:58.438 --> 00:04:03.677
- INSUBORDINATE AND CHURLISH.

00:04:03.777 --> 00:04:06.046
PITY.

00:04:06.146 --> 00:04:08.315
THIS IS THE BEST PART
OF THE STORY.

00:04:08.415 --> 00:04:10.817
AS HITLER WAS TAKING
HIS LEAVE OF ME, HE SAID,

00:04:10.918 --> 00:04:12.085
"WELL, THERE'S NO POINT

00:04:12.186 --> 00:04:13.587
IN GETTING BREAD
IF YOU'RE NOT GOING TO GET--"

00:04:13.687 --> 00:04:14.855
AND AT THE SAME TIME

00:04:14.955 --> 00:04:16.757
HITLER SAID "CHEESE,"
I SAID "CHEESE."

00:04:16.857 --> 00:04:19.193
AND THEN,
HITLER AND I BOTH SAID, "JINX."

00:04:19.293 --> 00:04:21.929
WELL, IT WAS JUST, LIKE,
TWO REGULAR, EVERYDAY PEOPLES.

00:04:22.029 --> 00:04:23.330
YOU GUYS MISSED THE FIRST PART,
BUT THIS IS ALL ABOUT HITLER.

